OL,5,G1820 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FThe B&B battle begins at the
OL,7,     FMayfield Hotel in Seaburn,
OL,8,     FSunderland. There's cause for
OL,9,     Fapplause when a seal makes an
OL,10,     Fappearance, but some guests get
OL,11,     Fpicky about the paintwork.
OL,12,G1855 Four in a Bed
OL,13,     FThe B&Bers descend on Gateshead
OL,14,     Ffor the week's second visit, at
OL,15,     FSutherlands Hotel, where two
OL,16,     Fguests want revenge and are
OL,17,     Fdetermined to dig up some dirt.
